+/*
+ * Layer order, declared before any import so it is fixed for the whole bundle:
+ *
+ *   theme, base, components, utilities  — Tailwind + HeroUI, in their own order
+ *   ob-tokens                          — OpenBot semantic values (`--ob-*`, both themes)
+ *   ob-theme                           — HeroUI's published variables mapped onto them
+ *   ob-legacy                          — the pre-migration shadcn names, deletion planned
+ *   ob-app                             — app-level rules that used to be unlayered
+ *
+ * App declarations sit in layers ABOVE Tailwind's utilities rather than in no layer at all. An
+ * unlayered rule outranks every layered one regardless of specificity, so an unlayered `input`
+ * selector silently defeats `.text-sm`; that exact bug is still explained below. Layer order is
+ * also why the theme bridge wins over HeroUI's `@layer base` defaults without `!important`.
+ */
